":"宋"}},{"title":"咏唐史 韦见素","author":"韦骧","text":"入相年馀值狂寇，独随车驾岂非忠。\n凶胡萌祸根荄远，史笔如何罪及公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45997,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏唐史 契苾何力","author":"韦骧","text":"自称烈士受唐恩，宁死延陀不屈身。\n莫陋将军本蕃种，中朝似此几何人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45998,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏唐史 李光弼","author":"韦骧","text":"阃外分忧屡积勋，间言几欲变深恩。\n十年三觐劳方面，荣耀双旌并在门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45999,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏唐史 邓景山","author":"韦骧","text":"并门雄镇军权重，敛怨残躯不足伤。\n偏将赎身由纳马，贱人贵畜自为殃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46000,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏唐史 韦坚","author":"韦骧","text":"勿诧崔生得体歌，运潭聚敛一何多。\n术虽可鄙非其死，甚矣奸臣恣网罗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46001,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏唐史 房琯","author":"韦骧","text":"蜀途赴难忠虽固，车战亡师咎已深。\n天子未归京未复，不知何暇有琴心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46002,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏唐史 崔荛","author":"韦骧","text":"大臣许国当由道，执政如何事佛淫。\n身附奸